    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28061" root="عثن" body-key="E">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَثَنَتِ النَّارُ</span></b> , (S, K,) aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَثُنَ</span></b> , (S,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَثْنٌ</span>
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُثَانٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُثُونٌ</span>, (K,) <i>The fire smoked,</i> or
<i>sent up smoke;</i> (S, K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عثّنت</span></b> . (K.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَثَنَ فِى الجَبَلِ</span>, (K,) aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَثُنَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَثْنٌ</span>,
(TA,) <i>He ascended the mountain:</i> (K, TA:)
like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَفَنَ</span>: mentioned by Kr. (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَثِنَ</span>,
aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَثَنَ</span></b> , (K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَثَنٌ</span>, (TK,) said af garment, <i>It became perfumed with the odour of
incense,</i> or <i>some substance for fumigation.</i> (K, *
TA.)

